title: "CEUA: A Benchmark for Evaluating Chinese Emotional Understanding and Application in Large Language Models"
abstract: "CEUA is an open Chinese emotional intelligence benchmark for evaluating large language models on Emotional Understanding (EU) and Emotional Application (EA): 412 four-option items derived from 206 underlying Chinese social scenarios."
type: dataset
